’de konakladığımız bu iki gün gerçekten çok güzeldi. Evin konumu harika, her yere yakın. Marketler, restoranlar ve birçok olanak hemen çevrede mevcut. Ev yeterince temizdi ve tüm ihtiyaçlarımız düşünülmüştü. Bu harika konaklama için çok teşekkür ederim, kesinlikle tavsiye ederim. 🌟","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5843820,"review":"I really enjoyed my stay at Xuru Stays Heliopolis. The apartment was clean, stylish, and in a great location( right next to the airport and away from busy Cairo ) . Loved the TV / jacuzzi  in the bedroom. The host was responsive and check-in was smooth. Definitely recommend for anyone visiting Cairo.","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5844744,"review":"Positive:\nكل شي رائع\n\nNegative:\nرائعة جدا","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5859698,"review":"Excellent apartment, exactly as listed and very clean.","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5862652,"review":"Positive:\nResponsive staff\n\nNegative:\nNone","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5865834,"review":"Really nice condo, will stay again in the future","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z"},{"id":5876437,"review":"pretty good！","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5879861,"review":"Perfect stay\nFriendly personnel \n🌹","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5882521,"review":"Stayed for two days, very clean and responsive host. Easy check in process","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5892054,"review":"شقة جميلة جداً و افضل من الصور ، توقعتها استديو صغير لكن راقية وتفاصيلها ممتازة وتعامل المضيف من افضل مايكون ، سيتم تكرار الزيارة بإذن الله .. شكراً لكم .","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5900953,"review":"Elevator not working. Host tried to say it is temporary but we found out it was not working for a ling time and probably it will not be fixed ever.","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5902648,"review":"Posizione ottima, mi son trovata molto bene. Lo consiglio vivamente!","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5906257,"review":"Positive:\nLe confort, le jacuzzi.\n\nNegative:\nRien.","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5916640,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z"},{"id":5926730,"review":"Positive:\nالاثاث جميل والمكان نظيف جدا جدا\n\nNegative:\nالسعر مرتفع\nوطلبت منهم تمديد وقت بسيط للخروج ولكن رفضوا واخذوا على مبلغ \n\nمبدأ المال لديهم مقدم على العلاقات الإنسانية ومراعاة الظروف.\n\nأوقات الدخول والخروج عندهم مختلفين عن بقية العالم.","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5929163,"review":"Perfect stay","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5929963,"review":"Замечательные апартаменты, очень уютно и современно. Рекомендую.","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":5931709,"review":"房间与图片一致，设施都比较新\n但是房间属于塔楼，比较封闭，房间内有不好的气味\n床品质感比较粗糙，有轻微起球\nWi-Fi不能用，5G也不行，虽然房东最后提供了备用Wi-Fi，但是信号真的太差了，我出门后才接收到这个信息，差点无法值机\n整体适合转机临时住宿且价格便宜，但网络信号问题真的需要解决一下","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":6000517,"review":"جيد جدا","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6009132,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6024413,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6074031,"review":"شقة جميلة ومضيف متعاون وسلس جداً وسيتم تكرار الزيارة ان شاء الله ..","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6076262,"review":"I really like the cond, it’s very clean and beautiful also  near cairo international airport.","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6078283,"review":"Very clean linens and towels. Spotless clean place.","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6080559,"review":"Positive:\nبكل شي\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6082101,"review":"The place is clean and close to everything, and the staff are very helpful and their response time is excellent.","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6103550,"review":"Интернет на второй день стал не работать","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6125649,"review":"The location is very good and extremely close to the airport. The seating area is a bit small, but the beds were very comfortable. Unfortunately, the bathroom was not clean, which was disappointing and made us uncomfortable.","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6132684,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6156212,"review":"I have stayed befor in Novotel El Matar and believe it or not. This place is way better and less than half the price. They care about every single detail. From the fully furnished kitchen, to the comfy bed and good internet connection. The AC is so fine.  Highly recommend","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6178697,"review":"👎🏼","rental_id":248135,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}